|--------|---------|
| **Overall rating** | 4.8 – 5.0 ★ on TripAdvisor, Google Maps, and Booking.com. |
| **Visitor numbers** | Over 300 000 tourists per year (the highest for any cultural site in Sicily). |
| **Awards & recognitions** | • “Best Opera House in Italy” (2023) <br>• Listed in *Lonely Planet* “Top 10 Must‑See Theatres”. |
| **What makes it special** | • Italy’s largest opera house (capacity ≈ 1 900). <br>• Stunning neoclassical façade and a richly decorated interior (gold‑leafed balconies, marble staircases, frescoed ceilings). <br>• Home to the “Teatro Massimo Orchestra” and a permanent museum of opera history. |

---

## Detailed information

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| **Address** | Piazza Verdi, 90138 Palermo, Italy |
| **Google Place ID** | `ChIJN1t_t8ZkIxcR9V6K5V6Kc8U` (used for API calls) |
