| **11:30 – 12:00** | Free time – walk to **Quattro Canti** for photos. |
| **12:00 – 13:00** | Light lunch at a trattoria on Via Roma (try the local *arancini*). |
| **13:00 – 14:30** | Optional: visit the **Palermo Cathedral** (5‑minute walk). |
| **15:00 – 16:30** | Premium Backstage Tour (if you booked) – see the orchestra pit and stage machinery. |
| **16:30 – 17:00** | Souvenir shopping at the Teatro Massimo gift shop. |
| **17:00** | Continue exploring Palermo’s historic centre or head back to your hotel. |

